# Event$ Counter | ValidCard$ Card.Self | ValidSA$ Spell | Layer$ CantHappen:
# Kavu Chameleon on the stack has no ActiveZones$, so its own line applies
# from the stack. ai's Counterspell resolves and counters nothing; the
# Chameleon then resolves onto the battlefield.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 G
tapformana human 3 G
tapformana human 4 G
tapformana human 5 G
tapformana human 6 G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
castspell human 1
tapformana ai 8 U
tapformana ai 9 U
queue targets 1
castspell ai 10
resolvestack
